claim.claim-text:
(a) a body;
(b) a needle extending from the body;
(c) a tissue sample holder mounted to the body and in communication with the needle to receive one or more tissue samples, the needle and tissue sample holder together defining a sample collection path; and
(d) a sample sensor positioned along the sample collection path, the sample sensor including an infrared imaging element adapted to receive radiation that has passed through the one or more tissue samples.
